WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.869
One tap puts the whole Popkin on a video call.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.252
On the Popkin home, choose Group call.

00:00:10.452 --> 00:00:14.120
In the Everyone thread, it is Start group call, in the top bar.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.178
While your camera and microphone get ready, it says Connecting, and Joining the

00:00:20.178 --> 00:00:20.742
call.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.808
Then you are in, on a dark stage, under the Popkin's emoji and name. Just you,

00:00:26.808 --> 00:00:29.759
twelve seconds. Your own tile is named You.

00:00:29.959 --> 00:00:33.447
Waiting for the others, it says, and offers Invite to call.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.584
Join a call under way: six on the call, twelve minutes forty-eight. Every tile

00:00:38.584 --> 00:00:40.118
carries a first name.

00:00:40.318 --> 00:00:43.563
A ring in the Popkin's colour goes round whoever is speaking.

00:00:43.763 --> 00:00:49.132
A camera that is off shows an avatar. And a muted microphone sits beside Sam's name.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.468
On a phone, six tiles are two across.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.778
From six hundred and forty pixels, three across.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.461
From twelve eighty, a pane lists who is On the call, and says: eight others in

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:03.706
Lakeside Weekend can join anytime.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.986
Two people sit one above the other on a phone, and side by side from six forty.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.401
Choose Mute. It becomes Unmute and inverts, and your tile shows the muted

00:01:14.401 --> 00:01:15.364
microphone.

00:01:15.564 --> 00:01:19.679
Choose Camera. It becomes Camera off, and your tile shows your avatar.

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:22.312
Leave takes you back to the screen you came from.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.871
Minimise call opens the Popkin home, with the call still running.

00:01:28.071 --> 00:01:31.705
A banner says: Group call, six on the call, with Return.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.256
Everyone else sees the banner too, on the home and in the Everyone thread, with

00:01:36.256 --> 00:01:36.825
Join.

00:01:37.025 --> 00:01:41.514
It appears when someone starts a call, follows the count, and goes when the last

00:01:41.514 --> 00:01:42.599
person leaves.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.691
Refuse the microphone and camera, and the call says Not connected: We can’t reach

00:01:48.691 --> 00:01:50.497
your camera or microphone.

00:01:50.697 --> 00:01:54.620
It says how to allow them, with Try again, and Back to the Popkin.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:00.573
What no screen shows: sound and picture go from browser to browser, and never

00:02:00.573 --> 00:02:02.358
through Popkin's servers.

00:02:02.558 --> 00:02:06.171
Still to come: calling one person from a direct message.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.636
That is journey seven. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
